ve_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111947","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111947","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111947.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111947.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"* Prepares for #106873\r\n\r\nOn `master`, when running the godot executable, multiple class registration warnings appear. \r\nSome of these, which this PR focuses on, are simply a matter of registration order or not being registered at all.\r\n\r\nThe other two PR focus on the remaining issues:\r\n* #111948\r\n* #111950\r\n\r\nWith all three PRs combined, I no longer get any warnings when running the engine and landing on the project list. Opening a project still causes ~350 warnings though, which will be the focus of future PRs. \r\n\r\nThe changes that are not registration are cascading and required for compilation. Namely:\r\n* Replace `<include>` with `\"include\"` in `nav_map_2d.h` and `nav_agent_2d.h` - I am not sure why adding the registration causes this to be required, but the compiler said so.\r\n* Added default `StringName()` value to `GDScriptNativeClass`'s constructor. This class needs to be a `GDCLASS` and not a `GDSOFTCLASS` (or it causes a lot of issues), and all registered classes must have a default constructor. \r\n\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\nAdd missing `GodotNavigationServer2D` class registration and necessary include changes for compilation.\r\nRegister `GDScriptNativeClass` as internal class.\r\nCall `memnew()` after registering `JavaClassWrapper`.\r\nRemove duplicate registration of `Shader`.\r\nregister `NavigationMeshGenerator` before `memnew()`.\r\nremove duplicate `RenderingDevice` registration.\r\nregister `Performance` before creating the object.\r\n</details>","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111947/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111947/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}